## Distribution Branding Settings for WilburOS
---
componentName:  wilburos

welcomeStyleCalamares:   false
welcomeExpandingLogo:    true

windowExpanding:    normal
windowSize:         800px,600px
windowPlacement:    center

sidebar: widget
navigation: widget

strings:
    productName:         WilburOS
    shortProductName:    WilburOS
    versionedName:       WilburOS
    shortVersionedName:  WilburOS
    bootloaderEntryName: WilburOS
    productUrl:          https://github.com/kildevaeld/wilburos-packages
    supportUrl:          https://github.com/kildevaeld/wilburos-packages/issues
    knownIssuesUrl:      https://github.com/kildevaeld/wilburos-packages/issues
